"banff_wv_cascades_of_time_gardens","areaId":"banff","name":"Cascades of Time Gardens","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":51.17086,"lng":-115.57245},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_cascades_of_time_gardens","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":36,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["cascadesoftimegardens","banff"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"Designed and built in the 1930s, the Cascades of Time gardens cover 1.6 hectares (4 acres) in the Banff townsite, in front of the Administration Building and behind it. The rustic timber and stone [http://www.historicplaces.ca/en/rep-reg/place-lieu.aspx?id=9586 pavilions] in the garden are Recognized Federal Heritage Buildings.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Banff","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Columbian_ground_squirrel_%28Urocitellus_columbianus%29_Banff.jpg/1280px-Columbian_ground_squirrel_%28Urocitellus_columbianus%29_Banff.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Columbian_ground_squirrel_%28Urocitellus_columbianus%29_Banff.jpg/500px-Columbian_ground_squirrel_%28Urocitellus_columbianus%29_Banff.jpg","w":1200,"h":793,"author":"Charles J. Sharp","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Columbian_ground_squirrel_(Urocitellus_columbianus)_Banff.jpg"}},{"id":"banff_wv_rocky_mountain_raft_tours","areaId":"banff","name":"Rocky Mountain Raft Tours","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":51.1646,"lng":-115.55642},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_rocky_mountain_raft_tours","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.banffrafttours.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":11,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["rockymountainrafttours","banff"],"summary":"Float trips down the Bow River starting near the base of Bow Falls. The only rafting trips that take place inside Banff National Park; other rafting operators will pick you up in Banff and then start the trip somewhere outside the park. Season is from mid-May to late Sept.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Banff","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Bow_Falls%2C_Banff%2C_south_view_20240820_1.jpg/1280px-Bow_Falls%2C_Banff%2C_south_view_20240820_1.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Bow_Falls%2C_Banff%2C_south_view_20240820_1.jpg/500px-Bow_Falls%2C_Banff%2C_south_view_20240820_1.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"DXR","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bow_Falls,_Banff,_south_view_20240820_1.jpg"}},{"id":"banff_the_banff_centre","areaId":"banff","name":"The Banff Centre","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":51.1734,"lng":-115.56085},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"banff_the_banff_centre","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.banffcentre.ca/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":2,"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["thebanffcentre","banff"],"summary":"A globally respected arts and cultural centre featuring performances and events with dance, music, theatre, opera, film, books, new media, and visual arts.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Banff","names":{"nl":"Banff Centre for Arts and Creativity","de":"Banff Centre for Arts and Creativity","fr":"Centre des arts de Banff","es":"Banff Centre for Arts & Creativity","it":"Banff Centre for Arts & Creativity","ru":"Центр искусств и творчества Банфа","ja":"バンフセンター","zh":"班福中心"},"photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Banffcentre.jpg/1280px-Banffcentre.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Banffcentre.jpg/500px-Banffcentre.jpg","w":1200,"h":728,"author":"w:en:User:Staib","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banffcentre.jpg"}},{"id":"banff_wv_vermilion_lakes","areaId":"banff","name":"Vermilion Lakes","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":51.18122,"lng":-115.59424},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_vermilion_lakes","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["vermilionlakes","banff"],"summary":"These three shallow lakes make a marvellous foreground to dramatic Mount Rundle in the background. Come at sunrise or sunset to see muskrat and beaver and get great lighting for photos.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Banff","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Confluence_Of_Colors_%28243052591%29.jpeg/1280px-Confluence_Of_Colors_%28243052591%29.jpeg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Confluence_Of_Colors_%28243052591%29.jpeg/500px-Confluence_Of_Colors_%28243052591%29.jpeg","w":1200,"h":797,"author":"Bhasker Thodla","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Confluence_Of_Colors_(243052591).jpeg"}},{"id":"banff_wv_norquay","areaId":"banff","name":"Norquay","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":51.20311,"lng":-115.5983},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_norquay","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://banffnorquay.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["norquaybanff","banff"],"summary":"The closest mountain to the Banff townsite, and it is much used by the locals. It is unique in the area because you can pay for skiing by the hour, and night skiing is available on Fridays and Saturdays. There is a tube park for non-skiers (and non-boarders.) The ski season is a little shorter at Norquay, because it is at a lower altitude than Sunshine and Lake Louise, and snowfall is less consist","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Banff","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/.Mt_Norquay.jpg/1280px-.Mt_Norquay.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/.Mt_Norquay.jpg/500px-.Mt_Norquay.jpg","w":1200,"h":675,"author":"Khoshhat","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:.Mt_Norquay.jpg"}},{"id":"banff_wv_balkan_restaurant","areaId":"banff","name":"Balkan Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.17551,"lng":-115.57083},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_balkan_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.banffbalkan.ca/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["balkanrestaurant","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The Balkan restaurant first fired up its grill on Banff Avenue in 1982. The restaurant was the creation of Greek families out of their element in the cold Canadian Rockies who wished to bring the authentic flavors and warm festive atmosphere of the Mediterranean to this high mountain town. Check out their Tuesday and Thursday night \"Greek Night\" with live belly dancing, Greek dancing and plate sma","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_grizzly_house","areaId":"banff","name":"Grizzly House","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.17704,"lng":-115.57112},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_grizzly_house","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://banffgrizzlyhouse.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["grizzlyhouse","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A must-see, this was once a swinger's bar. This uniquely shaped restaurant downtown has telephones at every table with placemats that serve as a map so you can call tables to chat through your dinner. It is a laid-back, fun atmosphere and the food does not disappoint. A typical meal may consist of a Caesar salad to start, then a cheese fondue served with freshly steamed veggies and mouth-watering ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_the_meatball_pizza_pasta","areaId":"banff","name":"The Meatball Pizza & Pasta","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.18017,"lng":-115.56983},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_the_meatball_pizza_pasta","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://banffptarmiganinn.com/restaurant/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["themeatballpizzapasta","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Truth in advertising: the dinner menu includes pizza, pasta, and some creative meatball options. Several different takes on bacon, sausage, & eggs for breakfast, alongside the offer of a boozy start to the day if one so desires. Vegetarian choices available too.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_eden","areaId":"banff","name":"Eden","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.15118,"lng":-115.55929},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_eden","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.rimrockresort.com/dine-drink/eden/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["edenbanff","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"French restaurant using many local ingredients, with some Asian influences. Choice of several set menus (prix fixe) that change seasonally, one of which is vegetarian. 10-time winner of CAA 5-Diamond and \"Best of Award of Excellence\" Wine Spectator awards.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_three_ravens_restaurant_and_wine_bar","areaId":"banff","name":"Three Ravens Restaurant and Wine Bar","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.16996,"lng":-115.56035},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_three_ravens_restaurant_and_wine_bar","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.banffcentre.ca/three-ravens-restaurant-wine-bar","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["threeravensrestaurantandwinebar","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Fine dining with fine views. The restaurant uses fresh local ingredients and has an ambitious and creative kitchen that mostly succeeds in meeting its goals. The service is reportedly superb. Expect about $100 per person for a decent meal.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_banff_avenue_brewery","areaId":"banff","name":"Banff Avenue Brewery","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":51.1749,"lng":-115.57066},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_banff_avenue_brewery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://banffavebrewingco.ca/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["banffavenuebrewery","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"The local brewery in Banff operates out a darkened second floor space downtown. A good IPA for the craft beer snob, and a selection of other milder beers here for the tourist market. Elk pie and bison stew are on the menu.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_magpie_and_stump","areaId":"banff","name":"Magpie and Stump","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.17655,"lng":-115.57138},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_magpie_and_stump","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.magpieandstump.ca/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["magpieandstump","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A Mexican restaurant that specializes in margaritas and typical Mexican dishes. There is usually at least one night per week where margaritas are half-price, and if you go in early you are almost guaranteed to leave late.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_the_beaver","areaId":"banff","name":"The Beaver","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":51.18237,"lng":-115.56602},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_the_beaver","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.beaverbarbanff.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thebeaver","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Banff's liveliest and most central Backpacker bar. Nightly drink specials, $3 cocktails, $3.25 pints until 7PM every night. Open mic, trivia, live music and theme parties.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_mountain_chocolates","areaId":"banff","name":"Mountain Chocolates","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.17672,"lng":-115.5707},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_mountain_chocolates","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://mountain-chocolates.business.site/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mountainchocolates","banff"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Reportedly the only chocolate shop in town where the products are manufactured on site. They also have caramel apples, ice cream and other sweet things.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Banff"},{"id":"banff_wv_vistas_dining_room","areaId":"banff","name":"Vistas Dining Room","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":51.17159,"lng":-115.56103},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"banff_wv_vistas_d